cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the µPULLI manuscript and this repository."
title: "uPULLI-figures: figure-reproduction code and source data for the µPULLI manuscript"
abstract: >-
  Self-contained code and source-data tables that regenerate the figures of the µPULLI
  manuscript, "Label-free imaging reveals that cellular physiology is encoded in bacterial
  community architecture": reimaging phenotype landscape, training-set classification
  (numerical + DINOv2 embeddings), clean-deletion projection, and cross-system
  generalization (compounds, K. pneumoniae, multispecies).
